    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, the theorist identifies a root component of magic which they can invoke at any time. Whenever the theorist uses their hypothesis dice, they may choose the results of any four dice that they roll rather than rolling those dice. The results are chosen after the other hypothesis dice are rolled.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/theorist#toc39\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
